Package: rsystemd
Type: Package
Title: Introspection and Managed Mutation of 'systemd' Units
Version: 0.0.1.10
Date: 2026-08-10
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Structured queries of 'systemd' state (units, timers, unit
    properties, overall state, journal entries as plain data frames) plus
    managed unit mutations (start, stop, restart, enable, disable) with
    preview, idempotence, job correlation, timeout and cancellation
    handling, service-level authorization, and durable audit records (every
    attempt persisted through the 'runix' audit sink; caller-owned by default,
    honest about durability). Part of the Runix system-administration
    framework.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
OS_type: unix
SystemRequirements: systemd (>= 249, for systemctl JSON output)
Imports: janssonr (>= 0.0.1.1), runix
Additional_repositories: https://cornball-ai.github.io/drat
Suggests: tinytest
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
